WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.823
The same method can help with a different situation

00:00:02.889 --> 00:00:06.810
NEW FICTIONAL TRANSFER EXERCISE not a later Meridian case

00:00:06.823 --> 00:00:12.455
fact At 13:30 two executives request different reports one

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.902
by 14:00  and one by 14:15 Each report needs

00:00:17.915 --> 00:00:21.218
45 minutes of your focused work and neither can

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.718
be completed in parallel No priority change or additional

00:00:25.757 --> 00:00:29.467
support has been agreed You have no authority to

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:34.797
promise both deadlines Prepare a short recommendation identify the

00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:39.639
capacity problem compare feasible options name the decision needed

00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:44.178
and keep unresolved conditions visible Then explain how this

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.876
differs from the Monday diary case This is open-reference

00:00:49.152 --> 00:00:55.152
reduced-support learning practice Support is self-reported comparison is not

00:00:55.205 --> 00:00:59.613
an assessor mark Workplace competence and the approved formal

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.521
practical route remain separate
